From: Bettbox for OpenWrt contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Enable listener and TUN initialization during ApplyConfig

Upstream appshubcc/Bettbox embeds core/Clash.Meta behind a Flutter FFI host
and comments out updateListeners and updateTun in ApplyConfig. OpenWrt runs
the standalone mihomo binary from rendered YAML, so both must initialize
with every config load and hot reload.

--- a/hub/executor/executor.go
+++ b/hub/executor/executor.go
@@ -111,8 +111,8 @@
 	updateGeneral(cfg.General, true)
 	updateDNS(cfg.DNS, cfg.General.IPv6)
 	updateNTP(cfg.NTP) // initialize NTP after DNS because an NTP server may be a hostname.
-	// updateListeners(cfg.General, cfg.Listeners, force)
-	// updateTun(cfg.General) // tun should not care "force"
+	updateListeners(cfg.General, cfg.Listeners, force)
+	updateTun(cfg.General) // tun should not care "force"
 	updateIPTables(cfg)
 	updateTunnels(cfg.Tunnels)
 
